---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Loopy from '../components/Loopy.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 · rain" description="你访问的页面不存在或已被移动。" bodyClass="not-found-v2" noindex>
  <main id="main-content" class="not-found-main">
    <section class="not-found-grid">
      <div class="not-found-copy v2-reveal">
        <p class="v2-kicker">页面不存在</p>
        <h1>404</h1>
        <p>请检查地址是否正确。也可以回首页，或到文章列表重新查找。</p>
        <div class="not-found-actions">
          <a class="v2-button is-primary" href="/">返回首页 <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="v2-button" href="/articles/">浏览文章 <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Loopy variant="reading" />
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
